{"id":"n90954-4-6","stage":2,"title":"마디 · 节","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90954-4-6-1","ko":"너는 유민이랑 친하니?","zh":"你和裕敏熟吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"유민이랑","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"유민이랑","audio":"/audio/0a8fd5786e6034c31679.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이랑","audio":"/audio/0a8fd5786e6034c31679.mp3"}},{"text":"친하니?","meaning":"亲近，要好，亲密","explanation":"친하다：亲近，要好，亲密；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"친하다","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80614","senseId":"1","lemma":"친하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친하니","audio":"/audio/9817a16fc1adee47377b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"0275722d7b511a47","term":"친하다","zh":"亲近，要好，亲密","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3","entryId":"80614","definition":"近交相知，感情深厚。","pronunciation":["친하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5cde69944958544962db.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90954-4-6-2","ko":"아니. 한두 마디 이야기를 나누어 본 게 전부야.","zh":"不熟，只聊过一两句话。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니.","meaning":"不是，不用，不要","explanation":"아니：不是，不用，不要","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"한두","meaning":"一两个","explanation":"한두：一两个","readings":[{"term":"한두","audio":"/audio/8d8d0f049714d952426a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72433","senseId":"1","lemma":"한두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한두","audio":"/audio/8d8d0f049714d952426a.mp3"}},{"text":"마디","meaning":"句（计数话语的片段）","explanation":"마디：一段话中的一个片段；한두 마디 이야기 指一两句话，不是植物的节。","readings":[{"term":"마디","audio":"/audio/2fb0eaf6dcf7f5ea2675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90954","senseId":"4","lemma":"마디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마디","audio":"/audio/2fb0eaf6dcf7f5ea2675.mp3"}},{"text":"이야기를","meaning":"聊天，说话","explanation":"이야기：聊天，说话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"2","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이야기를","audio":"/audio/bce72d3b4d1b11764a95.mp3"}},{"text":"나누어","meaning":"交流，交换，交谈","explanation":"나누다：交流，交换，交谈；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"6","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나누어","audio":"/audio/eda1720aecb6604f7f22.mp3"}},{"text":"본","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"본","audio":"/audio/cf476351fc8f8f9d9a3f.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"전부야.","meaning":"全部","explanation":"전부：全部；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"